    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclamation is a 2.5D Metroidvania platformer sculpted out of real clay. Become your enemies as you explore a sprawling, interconnected world on a mission to restore the great beast Oogrim to its former glory. Discover 18 controllable enemies to possess, each with a unique combination of abilities that offer variation to moment to moment gameplay as well as access to new map areas that were previously inaccessible. But be warned, possessing a new body requires giving up your old one, so choose wisely.</p>",
